    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what does that even mean? \"let go of the weight\"? like, how do you just stop the equation? i can't just stop paying rent or stop having bills. everything has consequences. it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle and not be part of this math anymore is to just exit it entirely.",
